                            "playtime_at_review": 42,
                            "last_played": 1466268367
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "If you like this game, I would highly recommend the short animation Ptikobj, the surrealism and Northern English setting make both of these excellent bedfellows. It's a short game and as someone from northern England I really like the idea of a sequel where you can get immersed in the world a bit more because it does a great job of blending all these familliar cultural themes with a surreal setting, however this isn't too much of a bad thing either because the game doesn't overstay it's welcome; it's more or less as long as it needs to be. Another thing I'll point out is that the soundtrack is very good, from the Soviet sounding accordions to the chilled out bassy tracks.",
